# ============================================================================
# .codex — lore knowledge graph for the Courts of Stone "Crane Clan" essay.
# Stand-off over l5r5e-0.4-courts-of-stone-crane-clan.lore: every fact below is
# derived from that prose, which stays byte-verbatim and UNTOUCHED. This file
# points INTO it (SOURCE ... AT <heading-slug>) and records the verbatim surface
# phrase each edge was read from (FROM "...").
#
# DATA-ONLY codex: the CATEGORIES taxonomy and RELATIONS predicate vocabulary
# live in the shared l5r5e-0.4-codex-schema.codex, imported below via DEPENDS_ON.
# Clan/family carets (^"Crane Clan", ^"Doji", ^"Kakita", ^"Daidoji", ^"Asahina",
# ^"Lion Clan", ^"Matsu", ^"Shinjo", ^"Yasuki", ^"Crab Clan") resolve to the real
# l5r5e DEFs when validated in the 0.4/ corpus — so lore entities link straight
# to the mechanical clan/family DEFs.
# ============================================================================

CODEX "L5R5e_CoS_CraneClan_Codex" {
    NAME "Courts of Stone: The Crane Clan — Lore Knowledge Graph"
    VERSION "0.1"
